== a constant switch over a String ==
string: NPE
== an exhaustive switch over an enum ==
enum: NPE
== a pattern switch, which does not catch null ==
pattern: NPE
== a switch over a box ==
box: NPE
== case null is the shape that takes it ==
case null: null case
== and nothing changes when the selector is not null ==
non-null pattern: str:hi
non-null string: A
non-null box: one
== a null monitor ==
synchronized: NPE
synchronized: locked
